# What must never reach a build context: the developer's real configuration,
# their installed dependencies, and their build output. The image installs and
# builds from the lockfile instead, so a container is reproducible rather than
# a copy of whatever is on one machine.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
.turbo
**/.turbo
dist
**/dist
coverage
storage-data
test-results
playwright-report
.git
.github
.DS_Store
*.log
